# VMS-41R1 runner shell tests audit checklist

- [ ] Tests prove the default receipt is zero-model and only `READY_FOR_AUTHORIZATION`.
- [ ] Tests prove the six attempt plans have exact visible/writable/hidden file sets.
- [ ] Tests reject side-effect authorization drift and attempt map drift.
- [ ] Tests prove `--execute` fails closed before any live permit exists.
- [ ] Tests prove the runner imports no model, Solver, DB, network, subprocess or subagent surface.
